{"id":"Wf056c1f4bcfcb5832c3e92a5","zh":"","en":"FCN","name":"FCN","language":"en","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","concept_id":"Ce05c7b3eb28281e2f168","families":[],"definition_zh":"主要由卷积结构组成并用于文中扣件损伤识别的神经网络。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于根据振动信号识别钢轨扣件损伤。在这类检测网络中，以卷积结构替代全连接结构，使网络能够处理不同长度的输入，适应振动信号长度变化的分析需求。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wf056c1f4bcfcb5832c3e92a5","text":"FCN","language":"en","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S6479930ee33fdc0af5e7","source_id":"P048","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"To address this lim-itation, this work presents a vibration-based detection method by introducingthefullyconvolutionalnetwork(FCN)toidentifyinvisible damages of fasteners.","citations":[{"source_id":"P048","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sff677668d1257db8b763","source_id":"P048","page":9,"page_end":9,"language":"en","text":"Thus the FCN, one branch of CNNs, which replaces the fully connected layer with the convolutional layer for addressing the input with any length, is introduced by ‘Overfeat’ [30].","citations":[{"source_id":"P048","page":9,"page_end":9}]}],"sources":{"P048":{"id":"P048","title":"Vibration-based damage detection of rail fastener using fully convolutional networks","authors":"M Chen, W Zhai, S Zhu, L Xu, Y Sun","year":"2022","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2021.1896010","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 60 (7), 2191-2210","label":"Chen等（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-vibration-based-damage-detection-of-rail-fastener-using-fully-convolutional-networks"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W94a26c9eeb206537f74026ab","name":"fully convolutional network","language":"en","kind":"variant","label":"名称变体","reason":null},{"id":"We3dccba83e1f5344736b9c88","name":"Fully convolutional network (FCN)","language":"en","kind":"variant","label":"名称变体","reason":null},{"id":"We551ddc7f7b48a2d91968054","name":"全卷积网络","language":"zh","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W94a26c9eeb206537f74026ab","name":"fully convolutional network","language":"en","kind":"variant","label":"名称变体","reason":null},{"id":"We3dccba83e1f5344736b9c88","name":"Fully convolutional network (FCN)","language":"en","kind":"variant","label":"名称变体","reason":null},{"id":"We551ddc7f7b48a2d91968054","name":"全卷积网络","language":"zh","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"We551ddc7f7b48a2d91968054","name":"全卷积网络","language":"zh","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P048","title":"Vibration-based damage detection of rail fastener using fully convolutional networks","authors":"M Chen, W Zhai, S Zhu, L Xu, Y Sun","year":"2022","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2021.1896010","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 60 (7), 2191-2210","label":"Chen等（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-vibration-based-damage-detection-of-rail-fastener-using-fully-convolutional-networks"}]}